# 二进制文件：不做行尾转换，不做文本 diff
*.exe binary
*.dll binary
*.dylib binary
*.so binary
*.a binary
*.lib binary
*.pdb binary
*.png binary
*.ico binary
*.icns binary
*.dmg binary
*.deb binary
*.AppImage binary
*.zip binary

# 文本文件：统一 LF（Windows 侧脚本除外）
* text=auto eol=lf
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf
*.nsh text eol=crlf
*.sln text eol=crlf
*.vcxproj text eol=crlf